PaceBack is an unvalidated mental-wellbeing research prototype. It is not
intended to diagnose, treat, monitor crisis, guarantee calm, or replace
professional or emergency care.

The product and documentation cite public guidance and research from the World
Health Organization, the U.S. National Institute of Mental Health, the U.S.
National Center for Complementary and Integrative Health, and published
systematic reviews. They also discuss public repositories and commercial apps
as design references. Citation does not imply endorsement, and none of these
sources tested PaceBack.

PaceBack contains no redistributed model weights or third-party runtime code.
The application is built with Apple system frameworks. The PaceBack icon was
generated with OpenAI's image-generation tool and converted locally to ICNS;
this attribution is not a completed trademark or rights review.
